Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

**Merged as one issue, then split.** The reports were merged on subject line. Read by tenant, way in
and body, they are three problems: the parser reads dates month first, the `booking-v3` form hint
tells people to type month first, and a few bookings move by one day. Each has its own ticket.

<Callout kind="warn">
Split. One problem, one ticket: see <a href="/kb/incidents/4471/split">#4471, split</a>. The parser fix alone does not close this.
</Callout>

## What was merged

